eciation accelerates the rate of depreciation, so that more depreciation expense occurs in earlier periods than in later ones. The useful life is the number of periods, typically years, over which an asset is depreciated. ":"使用年数总和法计算某一资产在指定期限内的累计折旧。该折旧方法会加快折旧率，因此前期比后期发生更多折旧费用。可用年限指该资产折旧的周期（通常为年）数。","Calculates the depreciation allowance on an asset for a specified period of time, using the double-declining balance method.":"使用双倍余额递减法计算指定时间段内资产的累计折旧。","Calculates the future value of an investment based on a series of equal payments at a periodic interest rate over the number of payment periods in the term.":"计算某投资的未来值，按照期限内有若干个付款周期、等额付款、每期固定利率。","Calculates the number of compounding periods necessary to increase an investment of present value to a future value, at a fixed interest rate per compounding period.":"计算某投资的现值增加到某一未来值需要的复利周期数，每个复利周期的利率固定。","Calculates the number of payment periods that are necessary during the term of an ordinary annuity, to accumulate a future value, at a periodic interest rate.":"计算在普通年金期限内以定期利率累积未来值所需的支付期数。","Calculates the periodic interest necessary to increase an investment to a future value, over the number of compounding periods. ":"计算某投资经过一定复利期数后增加到某一未来值所所需要的每期利率。","Calculates the present value of an investment based on a series of equal payments discounted at a periodic interest rate over the number of payment periods in the term. ":"计算某投资的现值，按照期限内有若干个付款周期、等额付款、每期按固定利率贴现。","Calculates the resale price of a product, based on the product cost and the wanted gross profit margin.":"计算某产品的转售价格，按产品成本及期望的毛利率。","Calculates the straight-line depreciation of an asset for one period. The straight-line method of depreciation divides the depreciable cost evenly over the useful life of an asset. The useful life is the number of periods, typically years, over which an asset is depreciated. ":"计算某一期限内某资产的直线折旧。直线折旧法在某资产可用年限内均分折旧成本。可用年限指该资产折旧的期数，典型情况下为年。","Calculating":"正在计算","Calculator":"计算器","Calculator with financial and scientific modes.\nUsi